sequenceDiagram
    participant OP as Operator
    participant DS as deploy.sh
    participant DB as SQLite Backup
    participant DK as Docker Engine
    participant API as lms-api
    participant WEB as lms-web
    participant HC as Health Check
    participant SM as Smoke Test
    participant DV as Data Verify
    participant RB as rollback.sh

    Note over OP,DV: AUTH-11 Deploy: SHA 0dd2385 -> 27f9535 (PR #76, merge 8abf282)

    OP->>DS: ./scripts/deploy.sh

    Note over DS: Pre-deploy checks
    DS->>DS: Verify docker, docker compose available
    DS->>DS: Check disk space >= 500MB
    DS->>DS: Capture BUILD_SHA from git HEAD

    Note over DS,DB: Pre-deploy database backup
    DS->>DB: sqlite3 .backup pre-deploy_{timestamp}.db
    DB-->>DS: Backup file created
    DS->>DS: Verify backup size >= 4096 bytes
    alt Backup failed or too small
        DS->>OP: ABORT: backup failure
    end

    Note over DS,DK: Save rollback state
    DS->>DK: docker inspect lms-api, lms-web image IDs
    DK-->>DS: Current image SHAs
    DS->>DS: Write .deploy-state/previous-images.txt

    Note over DS,DK: Volume ownership migration (one-time for AUTH-11)
    DS->>DK: docker run --rm -v lms-data busybox chown -R 1000:1000
    DS->>DK: docker run --rm -v lms-uploads busybox chown -R 1000:1000

    Note over DS,DK: Build new images
    DS->>DK: docker compose build (BUILD_SHA=27f9535)
    DK-->>DS: Images built with USER node + read_only

    Note over DS,API: Rolling deploy — API first
    DS->>DK: docker compose up -d --no-deps api
    DK->>API: Start lms-api (node uid=1000, read_only FS)

    Note over DS,HC: Health check (60s timeout)
    loop Every 2s up to 60s
        DS->>HC: curl https://lms.smwebsystems.com/api/v1/health
        HC-->>DS: Response
    end
    alt Health timeout
        DS->>RB: rollback.sh
        RB->>DK: Restore previous images, compose up
        RB-->>DS: Rollback complete
        DS->>OP: ABORT: API health timeout
    end

    Note over DS,WEB: Deploy Web container
    DS->>DK: docker compose up -d --no-deps web
    DK->>WEB: Start lms-web (nginx:alpine)
    DS->>DS: sleep 2 (nginx startup)

    Note over DS,SM: Smoke tests
    DS->>SM: ./scripts/smoke-test.sh
    SM-->>DS: Test results
    alt Smoke tests failed
        DS->>RB: rollback.sh
        RB-->>DS: Rollback complete
        DS->>OP: ABORT: smoke test failure
    end

    Note over DS,DV: Post-deploy data verification
    DS->>DV: verify_data (users>=10, courses>=3, nfts>=5)
    DV->>API: docker exec node -e "query row counts"
    API-->>DV: {users, courses, nft_credentials}
    DV-->>DS: Integrity result
    alt Data integrity failed
        DS->>OP: ABORT: row counts below thresholds
    end

    Note over DS: Build SHA verification
    DS->>HC: curl /health -> buildSha
    HC-->>DS: actual SHA
    alt SHA mismatch
        DS->>OP: ABORT: SHA mismatch (expected 27f9535)
    end

    Note over DS,OP: Deploy successful
    DS->>DS: Log DEPLOY SUCCESS to deploy-log.txt
    DS->>DK: docker image prune -f --filter until=24h
    DS->>OP: Deploy SUCCESSFUL (SHA 27f9535)

    Note over OP: Post-deploy: install monitoring crontab
    OP->>OP: Install lms-health-monitor.sh (*/5 cron)
    OP->>OP: Install lms-deadman-check.sh (*/15 cron)
